WEBVTT

00:02.880 --> 00:06.790
<b>I think you need a little more downtime
in your life, Jinya-kun.</b>

00:07.250 --> 00:09.750
<b>Why? Do I really seem that stressed out to you?</b>

00:10.210 --> 00:12.880
<b>More like broody, I suppose.</b>

00:13.250 --> 00:15.790
<b>You always seem to push yourself too hard.</b>

00:16.250 --> 00:18.290
<b>Yeah. That might be true.</b>

00:19.250 --> 00:23.000
<b>I'm only living for one thing.
The purpose that I must fulfill.</b>

00:23.540 --> 00:29.000
<b>I don't know what this "purpose" of yours might be,
but you should still let yourself relax on occasion.</b>

00:29.380 --> 00:32.170
<b>Isn't life boring when you do nothing
but pursue your goals?</b>

00:34.130 --> 00:36.170
<b>Even so, it's all that I have.</b>

00:38.080 --> 00:38.880
<b>Sorry.</b>

00:39.330 --> 00:41.460
<b>I don't think I can take your advice.</b>

00:42.000 --> 00:43.380
<b>What a shame...</b>

00:53.750 --> 00:55.380
<b>Know what these are called?</b>

00:55.830 --> 00:56.420
<b>No.</b>

00:57.040 --> 00:58.130
<b>Winter daphnes.</b>

00:58.920 --> 01:02.630
<b>The flowers start budding in fall,
then survive winter to bloom in spring.</b>

01:03.250 --> 01:04.750
<b>Such a strong fragrance.</b>

01:04.960 --> 01:06.420
<b>It's nice, isn't it?</b>

01:07.290 --> 01:10.750
<b>Blooming winter daphnes are the harbingers of spring.</b>

01:11.460 --> 01:12.920
<b>And the flowers over there are...</b>

01:13.380 --> 01:14.500
<b>Chickweed.</b>

01:15.170 --> 01:17.540
<b>Boiling the stalks makes for a good stomach medicine.</b>

01:18.330 --> 01:19.170
<b>In Kadono...</b>

01:19.790 --> 01:22.330
<b>In the village I used to live in, it was a popular cure.</b>

01:23.500 --> 01:25.420
<b>A childhood friend of mine took it all the time.</b>

01:26.170 --> 01:28.830
<b>She had a bad habit of eating sweets
at every opportunity.</b>

01:29.290 --> 01:33.000
<b>And overeating would give her stomach aches,
so I had to make sure she got the medicine.</b>

01:33.920 --> 01:37.750
<b>She sounds like a rather... amusing individual.</b>

01:39.290 --> 01:42.210
<b>There was hardly a time
when I wasn't dancing to her tune.</b>

01:43.960 --> 01:46.170
<b>There's clearly more to your life than you think.</b>

01:46.750 --> 01:52.830
<b>You enjoy eating soba, appreciate the beauty of flowers,
and have fond memories of the past.</b>

01:53.380 --> 01:58.080
<b>It's just that your obsession with this "purpose"
has made you blind to everything else.</b>

01:58.580 --> 02:01.330
<b>You must never believe that's all you have, okay?</b>

02:02.880 --> 02:06.130
<b>Please stop and live in the moment from time to time.</b>

02:06.830 --> 02:11.130
<b>Although you don't realize it,
there are flowers blooming all over.</b>

02:11.920 --> 02:16.880
<b>Once you look around, you'll be sure to find
many sights that you've never seen before.</b>

02:31.880 --> 02:33.170
<b>Well, here we are.</b>

02:33.670 --> 02:35.830
<b>Seems your father stayed up to wait for you.</b>

02:36.380 --> 02:38.040
<b>He's too overprotective.</b>

02:38.380 --> 02:40.750
<b>I imagine it just comes with being a parent.</b>

02:41.420 --> 02:45.170
<b>Oh? Then how do you explain
why you concern yourself with me?</b>

02:45.960 --> 02:47.460
<b>It's a mystery.</b>

02:49.380 --> 02:52.130
<b>I appreciate you escorting me back home.</b>

02:52.540 --> 02:53.210
<b>Sure.</b>

02:58.750 --> 03:01.960
<b>Teach me more about flowers sometime, would you?</b>

03:02.500 --> 03:03.080
<b>Huh?</b>

03:03.960 --> 03:06.330
<b>Preferably when the sun is out.</b>

03:07.330 --> 03:07.920
<b>Okay!</b>

03:12.670 --> 03:15.630
<b>Shucks. What a nice lady.</b>

03:19.630 --> 03:22.130
<b>Mosuke. You followed us?</b>

03:22.130 --> 03:25.290
<b>Whoops! I better get back to searching for the slasher.</b>

03:33.210 --> 03:38.830
<b>La-da-dee, la-da-dum, la-da-doo!</b>

03:59.630 --> 04:01.960
<b>N-nooooo!</b>

04:24.000 --> 04:26.080
<b>Wh-what on earth? What just happened?!</b>

04:26.460 --> 04:29.670
<b>You should stay still. Unless you prefer dying.</b>

04:50.710 --> 04:51.630
<b>Mosuke!</b>

06:37.080 --> 06:38.670
<b>Sorry. I let it get away.</b>

06:39.130 --> 06:43.130
<b>That's okay. I wasn't expecting it to be so tough, either.</b>

06:43.750 --> 06:44.790
<b>I'll stay on its trail.</b>

06:45.290 --> 06:47.630
<b>I might at least be able to find where it sleeps.</b>

06:48.290 --> 06:49.500
<b>Don't do anything risky.</b>

06:49.880 --> 06:53.670
<b>I'll keep my distance even if I find it.
I'm not interested in dying.</b>

06:54.080 --> 06:56.040
<b>You take care of that young lady, okay?</b>

06:57.920 --> 06:59.040
<b>Hey, you.</b>

07:00.250 --> 07:01.130
<b>What's wrong?</b>

07:01.750 --> 07:02.790
<b>Need some help...</b>

07:05.130 --> 07:09.880
<b>Jeez. I can't get up, okay? So give me a hand.</b>

07:13.670 --> 07:14.710
<b>Thank you.</b>

07:16.040 --> 07:16.580
<b>Sure.</b>

07:17.960 --> 07:21.460
<b>That cold and snippy attitude of yours
brings back memories.</b>

07:22.170 --> 07:24.330
<b>You haven't forgotten me, have you?</b>

07:30.040 --> 07:31.830
<b>Wait, Natsu-dono?</b>

07:32.170 --> 07:35.170
<b>Oh, good. So you do remember me.</b>

07:35.170 --> 07:37.170
<b>You weren't as big back then.</b>

07:37.460 --> 07:40.710
<b>Well, obviously. People can grow a lot in three years.</b>

07:41.130 --> 07:43.420
<b>But you still look the same as always.</b>

07:43.880 --> 07:45.500
<b>I'm immune to getting old, you see.</b>

07:45.830 --> 07:48.960
<b>Most women would put you
in the doghouse just for saying that.</b>

07:49.380 --> 07:51.080
<b>Is walking out this late a habit of yours?</b>

07:51.210 --> 07:53.000
<b>Don't be ridiculous.</b>

07:53.000 --> 07:55.670
<b>I was just coming home after making a delivery
to one of our good patrons.</b>

07:56.210 --> 07:57.420
<b>Working late, then?</b>

07:57.960 --> 08:00.080
<b>Yeah. Repaying a bit of kindness.</b>

08:01.290 --> 08:02.830
<b>You've changed, Natsu-dono.</b>

08:03.210 --> 08:04.250
<b>Really?</b>

08:04.250 --> 08:06.130
<b>You have a more natural smile now.</b>

08:06.460 --> 08:07.630
<b>Thanks.</b>

08:07.920 --> 08:11.710
<b>Well, it just goes to show
that I'm moving on from being a kid.</b>

08:12.000 --> 08:14.750
<b>Oh, please. You're still a long way from adulthood.</b>

08:13.790 --> 08:14.750
<b>Eeek!</b>

08:14.880 --> 08:17.210
<b>D-don't scare me like that!</b>

08:17.420 --> 08:21.130
<b>I go out of my way to check on you
and this is the thanks I get? Talk about rude.</b>

08:21.380 --> 08:23.210
<b>Oh! Jinya?!</b>

08:23.580 --> 08:26.040
<b>Zenji-dono. Nice to see you again.</b>

08:27.580 --> 08:31.170
<b>So, what's the story with you two? Is this a love affair?</b>

08:31.500 --> 08:33.880
<b>Natsu-dono was attacked by a serial killer.</b>

08:33.880 --> 08:34.540
<b>Huh?</b>

08:34.830 --> 08:36.880
<b>W-whoa, what the-?!</b>

08:36.880 --> 08:38.750
<b>This is no time for idle chit-chat!</b>

08:38.750 --> 08:40.880
<b>Q-quick, let's call for an officer!</b>

08:41.000 --> 08:43.920
<b>What good would that do?
They can't help against demons.</b>

08:43.920 --> 08:44.750
<b>Demons?!</b>

08:45.170 --> 08:47.830
<b>It's one that I've been hunting for some time now.</b>

08:48.040 --> 08:51.040
<b>Natsu-dono getting attacked
was just an unfortunate coincidence.</b>

08:51.750 --> 08:52.920
<b>More demons?</b>

08:53.420 --> 08:57.250
<b>Yeesh, it's like meddling in crazy stuff
is all you know how to do.</b>

08:57.250 --> 08:59.500
<b>Well, excuse me for existing!</b>

08:59.500 --> 09:01.750
<b>I wasn't talking about you, milady!</b>

09:02.210 --> 09:04.540
<b>So, how are you making a living these days?</b>

09:04.880 --> 09:07.670
<b>The same as always. As a demon-slaying ronin.</b>

09:08.170 --> 09:12.000
<b>Should you ever need my help, you can find me
at a soba shop in Fukugawa called "Kihei."</b>

09:12.460 --> 09:13.830
<b>I'll give you a discount.</b>

09:14.250 --> 09:15.460
<b>Not for free?</b>

09:15.750 --> 09:16.790
<b>Obviously.</b>

09:17.670 --> 09:19.790
<b>Since your escort is here, I'll be on my way.</b>

09:20.630 --> 09:22.250
<b>Thank you for saving me.</b>

09:24.540 --> 09:26.130
<b>Oh, hold on, Jinya!</b>

09:27.080 --> 09:30.080
<b>If you're after demons,
you should check out Teramachi in Yanaka.</b>

09:30.290 --> 09:33.750
<b>They have a temple that was abandoned
after the head priest passed away awhile back,</b>

09:33.920 --> 09:36.420
<b>but people have been hearing
a woman's voice coming from it every night.</b>

09:36.790 --> 09:40.830
<b>Now rumors are flying that
some kinda demon is living there.</b>

09:41.250 --> 09:42.630
<b>What is it called?</b>

09:42.830 --> 09:45.830
<b>I think it was... Mizuho temple.</b>

09:50.580 --> 09:54.170
<b>I'm pretty sure I went in the right direction,
but I guess not.</b>

09:59.040 --> 09:59.750
<b>It's close!</b>

10:27.330 --> 10:28.130
<b>Hatsu!</b>

10:32.460 --> 10:33.920
<b>That's the one.</b>

10:34.960 --> 10:37.790
<b>That's the demon I need to kill!</b>

10:41.580 --> 10:42.290
<b>MIZUHO TEMPLE</b>

10:43.670 --> 10:44.540
<b>MIZUHO TEMPLE</b>

10:44.540 --> 10:49.330
<b>MIZUHO TEMPLE</b>

11:04.960 --> 11:05.920
<b>Must go...</b>

11:15.250 --> 11:18.000
<b>So, you're the bastard who murdered my wife.</b>

11:20.040 --> 11:22.250
<b>You just eat them bones and all, huh?</b>

11:24.540 --> 11:27.330
<b>Whatever. That's not important.</b>

11:28.380 --> 11:30.130
<b>Must go home...</b>

11:33.170 --> 11:34.420
<b>I don't care.</b>

11:36.540 --> 11:37.830
<b>None of it matters!</b>

11:39.210 --> 11:41.500
<b>You son of a bitch!</b>

11:59.460 --> 12:02.250
<b>Am I just going... to die here?</b>

12:03.130 --> 12:05.080
<b>Without getting my vengeance?</b>

12:23.080 --> 12:24.290
<b>I'm such a failure.</b>

12:38.790 --> 12:39.630
<b>Mosuke!</b>

12:42.130 --> 12:46.170
<b>I really went and made a pathetic mess of myself...</b>

12:47.080 --> 12:48.170
<b>You found the slasher?</b>

12:48.290 --> 12:52.920
<b>Yeah. It was here, eating women whole.</b>

12:53.630 --> 12:55.210
<b>That piece of shit...</b>

12:56.130 --> 12:59.880
<b>It's the same one... the one who killed my wife!</b>

13:00.630 --> 13:01.960
<b>Wait, it ate them?</b>

13:02.710 --> 13:06.080
<b>Jinya-san, do me a favor...</b>

13:06.750 --> 13:13.710
<b>This here sword... was forged in a place called Kadono
and is supposed to work like a charm against demons...</b>

13:14.130 --> 13:20.290
<b>Please take it... and avenge my wife... for me...</b>

13:21.130 --> 13:21.920
<b>All right.</b>

13:22.290 --> 13:25.170
<b>But I would like your power in exchange.</b>

13:25.960 --> 13:29.630
<b>Sure. Anything for a friend...</b>

13:30.290 --> 13:34.170
<b>If you can make use of me, then by all means...</b>

14:49.920 --> 14:53.250
<b>You're a demon disguised as a human? Really?</b>

14:56.580 --> 14:57.500
<b>Go figure.</b>

14:59.290 --> 15:00.290
<b>And so what?</b>

15:00.710 --> 15:02.540
<b>Huh? Well...</b>

15:02.920 --> 15:07.960
<b>My heart still feels the same as always,
no matter if you're demon or human. I love you.</b>

15:21.080 --> 15:22.380
<b>I have heard your wish.</b>

15:23.250 --> 15:24.750
<b>And will see it done.</b>

15:44.000 --> 15:45.580
<b>When I first became cognizant...</b>

15:46.540 --> 15:48.460
<b>I was already in this demonic body.</b>

15:49.500 --> 15:51.540
<b>I knew I needed to kill men.</b>

15:52.130 --> 15:54.330
<b>Because that was the reason I was born.</b>

16:01.210 --> 16:04.130
<b>From then on, I was just constantly searching.</b>

16:05.250 --> 16:07.580
<b>For who? I don't know.</b>

16:20.290 --> 16:21.670
<b>I have to hurry.</b>

16:22.250 --> 16:23.210
<b>I must go home.</b>

16:23.920 --> 16:26.250
<b>To where? I don't know.</b>

16:27.250 --> 16:28.960
<b>But there was one thing I was sure of.</b>

16:29.670 --> 16:31.250
<b>I couldn't go home like this.</b>

16:32.080 --> 16:34.000
<b>Bye, Yunagi. See you again soon.</b>

16:34.210 --> 16:37.830
<b>Yes. You're welcome back any time.</b>

16:38.630 --> 16:41.130
<b>So I went out to abduct more women.</b>

16:46.250 --> 16:48.290
<b>I knew I needed to feed upon women.</b>

16:48.750 --> 16:52.460
<b>Because they had what my demonic body lacked.</b>

16:53.330 --> 16:56.250
<b>I must eat a lot and then go back home...</b>

16:57.130 --> 17:00.170
<b>Such a garish kimono. A prostitute perhaps.</b>

17:00.830 --> 17:02.880
<b>I think I heard her name was "Yunagi."</b>

17:05.460 --> 17:07.830
<b>Whatever. That's not important.</b>

17:08.380 --> 17:10.880
<b>I want to go home. Soon.</b>

17:11.380 --> 17:13.880
<b>Back to where... I belong.</b>

17:13.920 --> 17:16.880
<b>Surprising that you'd return to this lair
after it was discovered.</b>

17:28.880 --> 17:32.540
<b>It seems that your intelligence
is as primitive as your looks.</b>

17:48.130 --> 17:49.830
<b>Your power is rather problematic.</b>

17:50.250 --> 17:52.000
<b>But I have help this time!</b>

18:04.380 --> 18:06.880
<b>You also... feast?</b>

18:07.790 --> 18:12.000
<b>"Invisibility." That is the name of the power
I will use to end you.</b>

18:32.830 --> 18:33.540
<b>Demon.</b>

18:34.630 --> 18:37.130
<b>I wish to know something if you can answer.</b>

18:39.920 --> 18:45.960
<b>Since the very beginning, I've heard the number
of bodies left by the serial killer didn't add up.</b>

18:47.000 --> 18:51.580
<b>You would always kill men on the spot,
but abduct the women to eat here in your lair.</b>

18:52.170 --> 18:55.540
<b>The discrepancy makes perfect sense. However...</b>

19:03.710 --> 19:06.670
<b>It doesn't explain why the body
of Mosuke's wife was left behind.</b>

19:07.210 --> 19:12.630
<b>If you were truly the killer Mosuke was looking for,
then his wife should have been devoured without a trace.</b>

19:13.130 --> 19:14.580
<b>So who exactly are you?</b>

19:15.960 --> 19:18.170
<b>Need body...</b>

19:21.170 --> 19:24.580
<b>Can't go home... without body...</b>

19:25.080 --> 19:28.290
<b>You asked me earlier if I also "feast."</b>

19:28.750 --> 19:29.960
<b>The answer is yes.</b>

19:30.630 --> 19:34.710
<b>I feast upon other demons,
much like how you ate those women.</b>

19:35.380 --> 19:38.250
<b>And now, I will consume your power.</b>

19:40.500 --> 19:44.630
<b>Your power is "Dart." A temporary speed boost, eh?</b>

19:45.000 --> 19:49.080
<b>Activating it allows you to "kick" through the air
in a quick burst of speed.</b>

19:49.080 --> 19:51.630
<b>I see. This will prove useful.</b>

19:52.790 --> 19:54.460
<b>I've figured out your power.</b>

19:55.170 --> 19:56.880
<b>Now, what of your soul?</b>

20:08.000 --> 20:09.170
<b>I must go home.</b>

20:11.170 --> 20:15.000
<b>I must find a body. I can't look like this.</b>

20:15.500 --> 20:17.580
<b>Hurry. Must hurry.</b>

20:18.080 --> 20:20.750
<b>Must find it. Must go home.</b>

20:21.580 --> 20:22.750
<b>You are...</b>

20:23.250 --> 20:25.630
<b>I need to get back to him!</b>

20:26.380 --> 20:27.670
<b>What is your name?</b>

20:28.250 --> 20:30.210
<b>Ha...tsu...</b>

20:35.290 --> 20:37.540
<b>Just wait, I'll be home soon!</b>

20:42.750 --> 20:50.420
<b>All that you really wanted... was to go home, wasn't it?</b>

20:52.500 --> 20:54.330
<b>Mosu...ke...</b>

21:02.960 --> 21:07.210
<b>You poor thing.
There was never a chance of that happening.</b>

21:37.330 --> 21:39.920
<b>Ya know, we haven't seen much of him lately...</b>

21:39.920 --> 21:40.790
<b>Jinya-san.</b>

21:41.250 --> 21:42.830
<b>You're right.</b>

21:42.830 --> 21:45.250
<b>He hasn't come back since I said he could marry you.</b>

21:45.420 --> 21:47.500
<b>You never said that!</b>

21:47.960 --> 21:51.080
<b>But actually, I ran into him the other day
when I went out to Asakusa.</b>

21:51.500 --> 21:52.920
<b>And we chatted for a bit.</b>

21:53.250 --> 21:54.420
<b>Is that so?</b>

21:55.000 --> 21:58.170
<b>He said he would stop by for some soba
once his business was finished.</b>

21:58.630 --> 22:02.790
<b>Oh really? But I heard the slasher
suddenly vanished and the killings stopped.</b>

22:02.880 --> 22:04.790
<b>So isn't his job done?</b>

22:05.290 --> 22:07.210
<b>Jinya-kun said it wasn't over yet.</b>

22:07.460 --> 22:08.330
<b>Why's that?</b>

22:09.000 --> 22:11.170
<b>Because there were more demons to hunt.</b>

22:14.960 --> 22:18.750
<b>Yo. Things have quieted down.
Ready to go on the prowl again?</b>

22:19.130 --> 22:21.830
<b>Let's find a younger one this time.</b>

22:22.000 --> 22:25.920
<b>We should get another bitch
like the last one. The married kind.</b>

22:26.540 --> 22:28.380
<b>Jeez, you're such a sicko.</b>

22:28.380 --> 22:32.880
<b>Oh, come on! You know it's way more exciting
to ravish those prim and proper types.</b>

22:32.880 --> 22:36.880
<b>That last bitch wouldn't stop struggling
and yelling her man's name until the end.</b>

22:36.880 --> 22:40.170
<b>Oh, yeah. "Mosuke! Mosuke!" Was it?</b>

23:14.250 --> 23:14.960
<b>Mosuke.</b>

23:16.000 --> 23:18.460
<b>Rest easy knowing that your wife has been avenged.</b>
